{"id":"443371","name":"冬瓜排骨汤","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/443371/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"500g"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"450g"}],"sub":[{"name":"粉丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪排骨洗干净用水焯后加葱姜、大料煮。","img":"images/443371/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉丝用冷水浸泡10分钟。","img":"images/443371/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冬瓜去皮去瓤。","img":"images/443371/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗干净切成滚刀块。","img":"images/443371/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"排骨煮1小时后冬瓜入锅同煮。","img":"images/443371/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"粉丝入锅同煮。","img":"images/443371/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"食材熟，加盐、胡椒粉。","img":"images/443371/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可出锅享用。","img":"images/443371/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"煮排骨时要大火烧开水，改小火慢煮。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}